Z||000013||Ditz88GT||08-29-2001||01:01 PM||||Man, I hope I don't get flamed for this...but I have no problems with having a beater from Japan.  I've owned 4 Fiero and I loved them like a part of the family.  During this time I've also owned an 82 Civic (paid 900), 82 Tercel (paid 400) and an 87 Pathfinder (paid 3K).  I think I may alway own a beater from Japan along with my Fieros.  I think it makes life easier.  You can say what you want about rice...but it starts everyday for me (my toyota and honda looked like crap but...) with little or no overhead.  As for my Fiero, it has let me sit, not anymore than most cars but it has.  I really can't miss work, so I drive my beaters to work and I enjoy driving my Fiero on weekends.  Keeps the miles down on the Fiero and in turn keeps the chances of brake down lower.  This is not to say my Fiero isn't reliable....it's just not AS reliable as my imports, just my thoughts, that's all!  Please don't hate me....<P>------------------<BR>~Ditz88GT<P>E-mail: cditzler@hotmail.com<BR>AIM: Ditz88GT<BR>http://go.to/fiero||||reg||1
Z||000014||mshill||08-29-2001||01:26 PM||||Funny, my 86SE that I paid $750 for is fast becoming my most reliable car.  With almost 200K miles on it I rebuilt the V6 and replaced every piece of the cooling system.  Just recently my wifes 93 GMC Safari van dumped a water pump and then the alternator.  And my Taurus is really acting up stalling at idle and stumbling at 70mph. <P>||||reg||1
Z||000015||Ditz88GT||08-29-2001||03:16 PM||||Like I said, I don't think that Fiero are unreliable.  I had an 84 I paid 400 bucks for and never put a penny into, but on the other hand I've had Fieros I never stopped working on.  I figure If I drop 500 for a car I really don't give a crap about I can drive it till it dies and throw it away.  Even if it only last for 6 months (and I never had one of my beater import last less than two years), total cost is less than a hundred bucks a month.<P>------------------<BR>~Ditz88GT<P>E-mail: cditzler@hotmail.com<BR>AIM: Ditz88GT<BR>http://go.to/fiero||||reg||1
